### Cancel consultation (doctor or patient on that consultation)
### Run api/auth/login.http first — the jwt variable is captured automatically.
### Replace the UUID in the path with the actual consultation id.
PATCH http://localhost:8030/consultation/cancel/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?reason=Patient%20requested%20cancellation
Accept: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

###

### Cancel — no-space reason
PATCH http://localhost:8030/consultation/cancel/9c5ec2c7-f053-4b1c-ba85-afd0e61535c8?reason=schedule_conflict
Accept: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

###
